---
import HubLayout from '../../layouts/HubLayout.astro';
import Topbar from '../../components/Topbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<HubLayout
  title="About · Haug & Datter"
  description="About Jonas, Haug & Datter, and why I build apps in the evenings from Drammen, Norway."
>
  <Topbar variant="hub" />

  <section class="hero reveal">
    <h1 class="display">About</h1>
    <p class="lede">A small app studio run by one guy in Drammen, Norway.</p>
    <img class="hero__logo" src="/logo/haug-datter-skogen-en.svg" alt="Haug & Datter" width="300" height="300" />
  </section>

  <section class="blocks reveal">
    <div class="block">
      <h2>Who</h2>
      <p>Jonas. iOS developer from Drammen. Builds apps in the evenings after the daughter is asleep, and sometimes while she climbs over the keyboard.</p>
      <p>Haug & Datter is not a company. It's me, my daughter (two and a half, full of opinions), and a handful of apps we've built together. «We» is a generous stretch.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <h2>Why</h2>
      <p>I build apps I would use myself, and that my daughter would use. If nobody else wants them, that's fine. If someone else likes them, even better.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <h2>How</h2>
      <p>All the apps share a few principles. Local first. No analytics, no tracking, no ads. What you create is yours, and syncs via your Apple account if you want it to.</p>
      <p>One-time purchases, not subscriptions. Apps shouldn't gnaw at your wallet every month to keep working.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <h2>Stack</h2>
      <p>SwiftUI. iOS 17 and up. Plain Apple development, no third-party libraries without a good reason. The website is Astro, hosted on Cloudflare Pages.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a class="tx-link" href="mailto:jonas@haugogdatter.no">jonas@haugogdatter.no</a>
      </p>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size: 16px;">You'll get a reply from me, usually within a day.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer label="Haug & Datter · Drammen" />
</HubLayout>
